  "historyNote": "#1375, eff 7-1-79; ss by #1717, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #6057-B, eff 6-30-95; amd by #6344, eff 9-28-96; amd by #6468-B, eff 3-5-97; amd by #6780, eff 6-27-98, EXPIRES: 10-25-98; amd by #6813, eff 7-23-98; amd by #7615, eff 12-20-01; ss by #7879, eff 4-26-03; amd by #8129, eff 7-28-04; amd by #9462, eff 4-22-09; amd by #9791, eff 10-1-10; amd by #9906, INTERIM, eff 4-26-11, EXPIRES: 10-24-11; ss by #10000, eff 10-1-11; ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
